<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - McLeodUSA upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - McLeodUSA upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furman Selz LLC said Monday that it raised its rating on the shares of McLeodUSA Inc to a buy from a neutral and added the stock to its recommended list following McLeodUSA's acquisition announcement.</p>
<p>-- McLeodUSA, a competitive local exchange carrier and Consolidated Communications Inc said on Monday they signed a definitive merger agreement.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The acquisition improves McLeodUSA's near-term profitability thereby enhancing one of the catalysts driving the company's equity value,&quot; analyst W. Todd Scott said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Scott said the merger was a perfect fit with McLeodUSA's current operations.</p>
<p>-- McLeodUSA shares were up 2-7/8 at 27-3/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
